When checks fail on pull requests by Dependabot in your account and acme-org, once every check has settled, if the update type is minor or patch, run "Heal Dependabot PR" in the background; if it pushed, wait for the checks; if they pass, turn auto-merge back on if it was on, else merge it when GitHub allows; if they still fail, tell me. Once per commit, at most 2 tries per pull request.
